usage: agent_pipeline.py [-h] [--engines ENGINES] [--auto-merge-parallel]
                         [--once] [--dry-run] [--idle-seconds IDLE_SECONDS]

Autonomous agent pipeline: GitHub issue -> L0 spec -> executor -> gate -> PR.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --engines ENGINES     engine order for failover (comma separated)
  --auto-merge-parallel
                        mark parallel-task PRs ready with squash auto-merge
  --once                one round, then stop
  --dry-run             no push and no PR
  --idle-seconds IDLE_SECONDS
                        wait when no task is ready
